# helper then breaks the file's single wrapping transaction, so the trailing
# foreign_tables_are assertions (the last section of the file) cannot run. Every
# assertion before it (~428) runs and stays verified. Recording the real
# limitation rather than hiding it: multigres has no foreign tables.
